{
 "_comment": "Spark X2.5 4B on B-v6n (4 Oct): B's data with the HARD speech-to-text augmentation (asr_v9 --preset hard: 45% round-tripped, over half far-field or TV noise incl. 5 dB). Spark B-v2, the house's best heard model, fell from 84% typed to 69% at 3 m and 67% under TV noise on the 200-conversation Bundook set. Spark B-v2's recipe otherwise.",
